"text":"いろいろなことを経験させて頂けて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何が好きで何が不得意なのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろな事や景色を見て\n感じて思ったこともたくさんありました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番楽しかったのも\n一番嬉しかったのも\n一番幸せだったのも\n一番希望を持ったのも\n去年。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番辛かったのも\n一番泣いたのも\n一番苦しかったのも\n一番あきらめたのも\n去年。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、私はこの全部のことを\n明日からの毎日で越えたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近よく言われるのが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと1年、あと2年早かったら、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言われれば私だってそう思うよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今よりももっと違う未来だったのかなって思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今の私があるのは\n一年前の私も\n二年前の私も\n三年前の私も\n乃木坂46にはいって\nたくさんいろいろなことを思って感じて\n泣いて笑って\nあきらめなかったからだと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46に入ってまる三年。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年の、同じ学校に通っていた\n同級生は、学生生活の中での\n青春があって、\n楽しかった思い出がたくさんあると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、\n同級生のみんなの楽しかった思い出に\nきっと私はいないと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、自分でそれを選びました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳に向けて、成人式に向けて\n振袖を選んでる時、\n久しぶりに会うかもしれない同級生の\nみんなの思い出話にはきっと\n入れなくて、その話の中に私はいなくて\n悲しくなるかもしれないって思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、私は乃木坂46に\n青春の全てと思い出をかけました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46に入ってからまる3年。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいった時の年齢の16歳のままで\n気持ちは止まってます！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46にいる今が楽しくて幸せで\nたくさんの思い出もあって\nこれからもたくさんの思い出ができて\n私は乃木坂46で青春を駆け抜けます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここにいると、ずーっと\n青春時代を過ごせるような気持ちです！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生全体としては、\n去年13枚目シングル期間で、\n今までよりもずっと\nみんなとの全体の距離が\n縮まったと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつの時も\n未央奈が先頭でみんなを引っ張ってくれてると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も先陣切って堂々と二期生だけじゃなくて\n乃木坂46を引っ張っていけるような\n大きな存在になります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脅かす存在になります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このままじゃいられない！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このままでもいたくない！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"環境の変化や\nいろいろなことが変わるのが怖い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、変化しないことが一番怖い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰かの思いを動かせる\n誰かの思いを熱くできる\n人になりたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一年前！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幼い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(\n1\n)  くくさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎こんばんわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎こんばんは！コメントありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんはの「は」を「わ」という派の方だ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も元、そうでした！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(\n175\n)  あいさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんがファンをすごく大事にしてくれてるのが嬉しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text